.TH "SSHGUARD" "8" "January 1, 2025" "2.5.1" "SSHGuard Manual"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
sshguard \- block brute-force attacks by aggregating system logs
.\" Copyright (c) 2007,2008,2009,2010 Mij <mij@sshguard.net>
